WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A stranger stops you for directions. You begin answering.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A door blocks the person briefly. The conversation pauses.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The door clears. Someone else is standing there and continues talking.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
About half of pedestrians in the first published door-study experiment noticed the switch. This is not a universal rate.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A seamless story can hide a change. Look for the source, test the limits, and question extraordinary promises.
